cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Your Digital Life data, please cite it using this metadata and
  preserve the record-level source citations for values you reuse. Project-created
  structured data and schemas are CC0; original prose fields are CC BY 4.0;
  third-party titles and bibliographic metadata are not relicensed.
title: Your Digital Life data
type: dataset
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-10"
authors:
  - family-names: Gladd
    given-names: Joel
repository-code: https://github.com/Brehove/Your-Digital-Life
url: https://your-digital-life.org/
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  An evidence-traceable dataset for comparing the energy and water implications
  of common digital activities, with explicit units, system boundaries, source
  metadata, calculation methods, and verification status. The dataset license
  field applies to project-created structured data and schemas. Original project
  prose fields are CC BY 4.0, and third-party metadata retains its original terms.
keywords:
  - digital activity
  - energy
  - water
  - data centers
  - artificial intelligence
  - environmental impact
